        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]   We are going to escort you from Chernobog, which is the Ursus city we're currently in, back to Rhodes Island.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "We are going to escort you from Chernobog, which is the Ursus city we're currently in, back to Rhodes Island."
